title: KPD Media
new-page: true

@media
title: Media
on-arrival: kpd_media_timer = 6
view-if: kpd_media_timer <= 0 and not (labor_minister_party == "KPD" and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0)

The KPD will set the direction of their newspaper and radio

- @mobilize
- @campaign
- @ideological_stalinist
- @ideological_conciliator
- @ideological_brandlerite
- @radio
- @radio_2
- @radio_3
- @radio_4

@mobilize
title: Die Rote Fahne will mobilize the public against fascism, capitalism, and monarchism
view-if: (kpd_leader == "Thälmann" and kpd_stalinist_strength >= 80 and year >= 1930 and anticommunist_force >= 30 and not return_to_normalcy) or (kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and kpd_conciliator_strength >= 70 and year >= 1930 and noncommunist_force >= rfb_force and not return_to_normalcy) or (kpd_leader == "Brandlerites" and kpd_stalinist_strength >= 60 and year >= 1930 and anticommunist_force >= left_force and not return_to_normalcy)

Die Rote Fahne coordinates with the KPD and RFB to organize protests, rallies, and strikes

@campaign
title: Die Rote Fahne will highlight the failues of the SPD and the Weimar Republic
view-if: (kpd_leader == "Thälmann" and kpd_stalinist_strength >= 80 and (year < 1930 or anticommunist_force < 30 or return_to_normalcy)) or (kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and kpd_conciliator_strength >= 70 and (year < 1930 or noncommunist_force < rfb_force or return_to_normalcy))

Die Rote Fahne rails against the SPD's support of class collaboration and capitalism

@ideological_stalinist
title: Die Rote Fahne will tow the party line
view-if: kpd_leader == "Thälmann" and kpd_stalinist_strength < 80

Die Rote Fahne reinforces the stalinist party line

@ideological_conciliator
title: Die Rote Fahne will tow the party line
view-if: kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and kpd_conciliator_strength < 70

Die Rote Fahne reinforces support for [? if in_popular_front or in_left_front or in_popular_front_prussia or in_left_front_prussia: the ?][? if not in_popular_front and not in_left_front and not in_popular_front_prussia and not in_left_front_prussia: a ?] united front

@ideological_brandlerite
title: Die Rote Fahne will tow the party line
view-if: kpd_leader == "Brandlerites" and (kpd_brandlerite_strength < 60 or ((year < 1930 or anticommunist_force < left_force or return_to_normalcy) and ((kpd_radio == 0 and kpd_resources < 2) or ((kpd_radio <= 3 or kpd_radio > 5 or year > 1931) and (kpd_resources < 1 or kpd_radio > 9)))))

Die Rote Fahne reinforces the brandlerite party line

@radio
title: The KPD will fund a radio station
view-if: kpd_leader == "Brandlerites" and kpd_brandlerite_strength >= 60 and (year < 1930 or anticommunist_force < left_force or return_to_normalcy) and kpd_radio == 0 and kpd_resources >= 2

The KPD's new radio station allows the KPD to connect to people in a more intimate setting than before, spreading the message of <span style="color: #700000;">communism</span> along with music and other popular content. Since most proletarians cannot afford family radios right now, they are reaching the middle class, a fact of which many in their party are harshly critical.

@radio_2
title: The KPD will fund a radio station
view-if: kpd_leader == "Brandlerites" and kpd_brandlerite_strength >= 60 and (year < 1930 or anticommunist_force < left_force or return_to_normalcy) and (kpd_radio <= 3 or kpd_radio > 5 or year > 1931) and kpd_resources >= 1 and kpd_radio > 0 and kpd_radio <= 3

The KPD's new radio network has a mix of popular and political programming, and is proving a success.

@radio_3
title: The KPD will fund a radio station
view-if: kpd_leader == "Brandlerites" and kpd_brandlerite_strength >= 60 and (year < 1930 or anticommunist_force < left_force or return_to_normalcy) and (kpd_radio > 3 and kpd_radio <= 5 and year <= 1931)

The KPD's radio network has become a successful tool for spreading their message.

@radio_4
title: The KPD will fund a radio station
view-if: kpd_leader == "Brandlerites" and kpd_brandlerite_strength >= 60 and (year < 1930 or anticommunist_force < left_force or return_to_normalcy) and (kpd_radio <= 3 or kpd_radio > 5 or year > 1931) and kpd_resources >= 1 and kpd_radio <= 9

The KPD are continuing to invest in their radio stations. Both commercial and political radio are becoming more prevalent, making it harder to spread their message amidst the competition.
